The literary texts (gitanjali.txt, ancient_ballads.txt, jungle_book.txt,
golden_threshold.txt, glimpses_of_bengal.txt, sakoontala.txt) are public-domain
works taken from Project Gutenberg (https://www.gutenberg.org). bird_of_time.txt
is a public-domain work taken from the Wikisource text in Literature of Colonial
South Asia (Lehigh University, https://scalar.lehigh.edu/literature-of-colonial-south-asia/).
They are not covered by this licence.

The Adivasi Will Not Dance (Hansda Sowvendra Shekhar, Speaking Tiger, 2015) is
in copyright and is not included in this repository. The short quotations from
it on the website and in flora_fauna.py are given for criticism and review, and
they are not covered by this licence.
